hifiberry-pipewire-configs (1.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added 91-riaa.conf with RIAA equalization curve for vinyl playback
  * RIAA filter operates at 96 kHz with separate left/right channel processing
  * Includes highpass, peaking, and high-shelf filters to match RIAA standard
  * Added 91-hide-midi-ui.conf to hide MIDI devices from graph UIs

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Thu, 16 Jan 2026 09:00:00 +0000

